# Project identity

This workspace is **Booxin 手机启动器** (`com.booxin.launcher`) at  
`D:\all code in D\booxin launcher phone\`.

It is **not** FoldCraftLauncher / `BooxinLauncher-Android`. FCL is reference-only.

## Packaging

- Default APK build: `:app:assembleRelease` → `app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk`
- Do **not** run `:FCL:assembleRelease` unless the user explicitly asks for the FCL fork.

## Porting from FCL

When copying fixes from FCL (e.g. ForgeBootstrap), implement them under  
`app/src/main/java/com/booxin/launcher/...` in **this** repo.  
See `PROJECT_SCOPE.md`.
